# PC Build Checklist (BMW 530i Concept)

- [ ] CPU: i7-14700 or 14700K (with iGPU)
- [ ] Motherboard: B760M (Mortar, TUF, Gaming X)
- [ ] RAM: DDR5 32GB x 2 (64GB Total)
- [ ] GPU: RTX 4060 Ti 16GB
- [ ] SSD: 1TB NVMe Gen4 (P41, 980/990 Pro, SN850X)
- [ ] Case: DLX21 or L600 (High-airflow)
- [ ] PSU: 850W Gold
- [ ] Cooler: AK620 or AG620
- [ ] Service: Standard Assembly Service
- [ ] Final Verification & Screenshot

## Notes:
- Ensure all items are "In Stock" and compatible.
- Check quantities (RAM x2).
- Target price: ~2.1M KRW.
